WEBVTT

00:00:10.320 --> 00:00:16.090
Where's home... when you never felt safe...

00:00:34.860 --> 00:00:37.120
A young mind wandered astray,

00:00:37.660 --> 00:00:41.260
reality spinning in rage-full madness.

00:00:41.500 --> 00:00:44.180
Lenses blurred on the ramblings of despair,

00:00:44.800 --> 00:00:47.720
hands at my throat with a terror I can't share.

00:00:47.820 --> 00:00:50.700
Every hallway folds into the last,

00:00:49.860 --> 00:00:52.860
a house built crooked on a cracked-out past.

00:00:53.980 --> 00:00:57.000
I memorized the exits, never used a single one

00:00:57.320 --> 00:01:01.080
turns out the boy was hiding from the man he would become.

00:01:01.440 --> 00:01:04.980
Keep running but the dark just learns my name,

00:01:05.320 --> 00:01:08.600
every door I open is another cage.

00:01:08.720 --> 00:01:13.780
Where's home when you never felt safe?

00:01:14.220 --> 00:01:16.540
Where's the floor when it falls away?

00:01:16.660 --> 00:01:20.260
I built four walls out of everything I fear

00:01:20.680 --> 00:01:23.700
called it shelter, called it here.

00:01:24.100 --> 00:01:29.610
Where's home... when you never felt safe...

00:01:30.100 --> 00:01:33.080
Cold sweat sermon, no god in the room,

00:01:32.720 --> 00:01:35.540
just the echo of a kid that I outgrew.

00:01:36.960 --> 00:01:39.620
Mirror cracks and I don't know the face,

00:01:40.360 --> 00:01:42.960
swallowing the scream so it don't leave a trace.

00:01:43.160 --> 00:01:45.960
But there's a window where the morning gets in,

00:01:46.380 --> 00:01:49.440
first time in years I can breathe my own skin

00:01:49.840 --> 00:01:52.740
maybe the war's got a flag I can raise,

00:01:53.240 --> 00:01:56.220
maybe the smoke finally clears from the haze...

00:01:56.820 --> 00:02:00.520
I see a light and I'm chasing it again,

00:02:00.860 --> 00:02:04.300
tell myself this is where the healing begins

00:02:05.840 --> 00:02:09.340
My Northstar... more like tunnel vision,

00:02:11.380 --> 00:02:14.100
the light I chased just narrowed to a wound.

00:02:14.140 --> 00:02:17.560
The closer that I crawled, the smaller it got

00:02:19.480 --> 00:02:21.180
it wasn't a sunrise...

00:02:22.440 --> 00:02:24.680
it was the barrel of a thought.

00:02:24.780 --> 00:02:27.580
Follow it down, follow it down

00:02:29.340 --> 00:02:31.080
there was never any ground.

00:02:37.840 --> 00:02:42.540
NO GROUND. NO HOME. NO NAME.

00:02:42.880 --> 00:02:45.880
Just the four walls and the rage.

00:02:49.480 --> 00:02:52.240
Tore the map up, ate the page

00:02:52.540 --> 00:02:55.480
built the cage, built the cage.

00:02:57.580 --> 00:03:02.520
Where's home when you never felt safe?

00:03:02.760 --> 00:03:09.220
You stop waiting for the floor you learn to fall with grace.

00:03:10.320 --> 00:03:13.060
I burned the map so I'd never find the door,

00:03:13.220 --> 00:03:16.500
quit looking for a home and built one from the war.

00:03:17.580 --> 00:03:25.220
Where's home... ...it was never out there.

00:03:28.060 --> 00:03:31.860
It was me. Still standing. Still here.
